      "title": "bluetooth: Fix dissecting of packets received on LE Coded PHY",
      "message": "bluetooth: Fix dissecting of packets received on LE Coded PHY\n\nFix dissecting of packets received on LE Coded PHY. These packets\nwill include the extra field \"coding indicator\" after the access\naddress.\nThe assignment of phy in the common bluetooth context was missing,\nleading to this field being left out and the offset being wrong.\n",
      "author_name": "Joakim Andersson",
      "author_email": "joakim.andersson@nordicsemi.no",
      "authored_date": "2020-11-21T11:08:50.000+01:00",
